Which choice best describes the function of the underlined portion in the text as a whole?' WHERE id='pt6_rw_m2_q6';
UPDATE questions SET stem_html='<p>Under normal atmospheric pressure, water molecules form a tetrahedral network stabilized by hydrogen bonds. Extreme pressure destabilizes these bonds; piezophiles have adapted to it. Studies found a positive correlation between depth and TMAO concentration, leading researchers to hypothesize TMAO reduces water''s compressibility.</p><p><strong>Which finding, if true, would most directly support the researchers'' hypothesis?</strong></p>', choices_json='[{"id":"A","content":"Water molecules are impervious to TMAO even when distorted by high pressure."},{"id":"B","content":"TMAO retains its molecular shape as pressure increases."},{"id":"C","content":"A positive correlation between TMAO concentration and the rate water''s structure compresses as pressure increases."},{"id":"D","content":"Hydrogen bonds are more stable when TMAO is present than when it is not."}]', explanation_html=NULL, stem_text='Under normal atmospheric pressure, water molecules form a tetrahedral network stabilized by hydrogen bonds. Extreme pressure destabilizes these bonds; piezophiles have adapted to it. Studies found a positive correlation between depth and TMAO concentration, leading researchers to hypothesize TMAO reduces water''s compressibility.
Which finding, if true, would most directly support the researchers'' hypothesis?' WHERE id='pt6_rw_m2_q12';
